  unitName: Turbo Cyclaw
  unitId: 810125
  unitNumber: 8048
  description: Cyclaw was created by Gazia, a demi-god fallen into his abyss of power
    and stature during the days of the augmented wars in Athensphere. It was built
    in the form of a strong legendary beast to mimic its formidable size and aggression
    as a symbol of destruction and power. It was said that a powerful soul of a living
    cyclops was infused into its mechanical processes to enable it to rampage through
    the lands aiming to cause destruction and chaos. Through the rubble, it was able
    to reconstruct its processes and hardware efficiency with materials and knowledge
    gained.
  summonDesc: "DESTROY\u2026"
  fusionDesc: TURBO CHARGING.. .. ..
  evoDesc: TURBO UPGRADE COMPLETE.
